# CRLF prevention -- force LF for all text files
* text=auto eol=lf

# Python files
*.py text eol=lf

# Shell scripts
*.sh text eol=lf

# JSON files
*.json text eol=lf

# YAML files
*.yaml text eol=lf
*.yml text eol=lf

# Markdown files
*.md text eol=lf

# Binary files (no conversion)
*.pem binary
*.key binary
*.bak binary

# Vendored JS（2026-10-06 S9）：ECharts 5.5.1 min（1 MB，含 CRLF 敏感压缩体）
# 须标 binary，否则 `* text=auto eol=lf` 会改写行尾 ⟹ 与上游 sha256 不符
assets/echarts.min.js binary
